<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/gundem","name":"G\u00fcndem"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/mahmut-arikan-bugun-kayseride-iste-programi","name":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de! \u0130\u015fte saat saat program\u0131"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de! \u0130\u015fte saat saat program\u0131","articleSection":"G\u00fcndem","dateCreated":"2026-08-28T10:55:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-08-28T10:55:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-08-28T10:56:37+03:00","wordCount":395,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/mahmut-arikan-bugun-kayseride-iste-programi"},"articleBody":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de bir dizi programa kat\u0131l\u0131yor. 28 A\u011fustos Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc (bug\u00fcn) ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek Kayseri program\u0131 kapsam\u0131nda gazeteci ve medya mensuplar\u0131yla bulu\u015fma, Muhtarlar Derne\u011fi ve M\u00dcS\u0130AD Kayseri \u015eubesi ziyaretleri ile Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi yer al\u0131yor. Saat 10.50 itibar\u0131yla Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri program\u0131n\u0131n ilk aya\u011f\u0131 ba\u015flam\u0131\u015f durumda.\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri Program\u0131 Ba\u015flad\u0131\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n 28 A\u011fustos Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc (bug\u00fcn) ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011fi Kayseri program\u0131 saat 10.30\u2019da Gazeteci ve Medya Mensuplar\u0131 Bulu\u015fmas\u0131 ile ba\u015flad\u0131.\r\n\r\nKayseri\u2019de g\u00fcn boyunca farkl\u0131 programlara kat\u0131lacak olan Ar\u0131kan, medya mensuplar\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011fi bulu\u015fman\u0131n ard\u0131ndan ziyaretlerini s\u00fcrd\u00fcrecek.\r\n\r\nSaat 14.00\u2019te Muhtarlar Derne\u011fi\u2019ni Ziyaret Edecek\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri program\u0131ndaki bir sonraki dura\u011f\u0131 Muhtarlar Derne\u011fi olacak. Ar\u0131kan, saat 14.00\u2019te Muhtarlar Derne\u011fi\u2019ni ziyaret edecek.\r\n\r\nG\u00fcn\u00fcn ikinci program\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri\u2019deki temaslar\u0131 devam edecek.\r\n\r\nM\u00dcS\u0130AD Kayseri \u015eubesi\u2019ne Ziyaret\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, saat 16.00\u2019da M\u00dcS\u0130AD Kayseri \u015eubesi\u2019ni ziyaret edecek.\r\n\r\nMuhtarlar Derne\u011fi ziyaretinin ard\u0131ndan ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek M\u00dcS\u0130AD Kayseri \u015eubesi ziyareti, Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n g\u00fcn i\u00e7erisindeki \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc program\u0131 olacak.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nG\u00fcn\u00fcn Son Program\u0131 Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri program\u0131 ak\u015fam saatlerinde Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi ile devam edecek.\r\n\r\nKocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi saat 19.30\u2019da \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu\u2019nda ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek. Ar\u0131kan da kongreye kat\u0131larak Kayseri\u2019deki g\u00fcnl\u00fck program\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcrecek.\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n 28 A\u011fustos Kayseri Program\u0131\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011fi program\u0131n saatleri \u015f\u00f6yle:\r\n\r\n10.30 \u2013 Gazeteci ve Medya Mensuplar\u0131 Bulu\u015fmas\u0131\r\n\r\n14.00 \u2013 Muhtarlar Derne\u011fi Ziyareti\r\n\r\n16.00 \u2013 M\u00dcS\u0130AD Kayseri \u015eubesi Ziyareti\r\n\r\n19.30 \u2013 Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi\r\n\r\nYer: \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu\r\n\r\nSaat 10.50 itibar\u0131yla Gazeteci ve Medya Mensuplar\u0131 Bulu\u015fmas\u0131 ile ba\u015flayan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n Kayseri program\u0131, g\u00fcn boyunca ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek ziyaretlerin ard\u0131ndan saat 19.30\u2019daki Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi ile devam edecek.","description":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de. Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n 28 A\u011fustos (bug\u00fcn) Kayseri program\u0131nda ziyaretler ve Kocasinan \u0130l\u00e7e Kongresi yer\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2026\/08\/mahmut-arikan-kayseride-2.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan bug\u00fcn Kayseri\u2019de! \u0130\u015fte saat saat program\u0131"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","image":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"D\u00f6nd\u00fc Nur Demir","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"D\u00f6nd\u00fc Nur \u00d6z\u00e7elik","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/muhabir\/71\/dondu-nur-ozcelik"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"}}</script>


